OL,3,GNEWSASchool inclusion support service
OL,4,A'weak' in all categories
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inspection report has found a
OL,7,Fcouncil's secondary inclusion support
OL,8,F(SIS) service for young people with
OL,9,Fadditional support needs is "weak" in
OL,10,Fall categories.
OL,12,FHMIE Scotland visited Dumfries and
OL,13,FGalloway earlier this year.
OL,15,FIt found too many young people had
OL,16,F"very limited access to a suitable
OL,17,Flearning or education programme".
